cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use or refer to onbehalf, cite it with these metadata.
type: software
title: onbehalf
abstract: >-
  The setup is shared. The identity is not. onbehalf gives a team one
  reviewed AI harness setup on one shared Linux host. The runtime of each
  user runs in the Unix account of that user, with the logins and the
  personal model gateway key of that user. Git, GitHub, Azure and the model
  gateway record each action as that user. There is no shared account and
  no shared credential.
authors:
  - alias: Neverdecel
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Neverdecel/onbehalf
url: https://github.com/Neverdecel/onbehalf
